      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of severe vaginal pain associated with vaginal intercourse and thought to be caused by levator vaginae muscle myalgia is discussed. Both the patient's grandmother and great-grandmother had had identical symptoms; in both of those cases the pain disappeared following the first vaginal delivery of a child."},
